      "content": "it's just so loud. the effort of it all. i look at people just living their lives and it feels like i'm watching a movie in a language i don't speak. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the noise and finally just... be still... is to just stop trying altogether. it feels like the only logical conclusion to this much exhaustion.",
